<title>USA: Orleans PSD, La., won by Lehman Bros.</title>
<headline>Orleans PSD, La., won by Lehman Bros.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Bros. said it won $35 million of Orleans Parishwide SD, La., general obligation school bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.42 percent.</p>
</text>
